# Outlaws' Fury's "if you control an outlaw" (CR 700.12a): Bot1 controls only Memnite (not an outlaw) and Bot2's Triton Shorethief is an outlaw Bot1
# does not control, so Bot1's Memnite still gets +2/+0 but nothing is exiled and Bot1's library is untouched beyond the turn-three draw.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Memnite
Outlaws' Fury
Island
Island
Forest
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Triton Shorethief
Island x20

